column4:
Focus position: 81 09 04 48 FF
PTZ position: 81 09 06 12 FF
Zoom position: 81 09 04 47 FF
ZOOM control: 81 01 04 47 00 0p 0q 0r 0s FF
00 is the speed, this is the speed level of ZOOM zooming, in fact, the default is the speed level of 05, and the fastest zooming is the speed level of 07;
0p 0q 0r 0s is the same position;
